## Metadata

- Artefact: S04 Data Entity Catalogue
- Phase: c
- Purpose: List the declarations, projections, tables and artefacts S04 creates or relies on.
- Scope: S04 persistence and derived artefacts; the event table exists from S02 but S04 writes no event row.

## Entries

- **Declaration / ActionSpec** - {"detail": "Fields: name, version, kind, input/output schema functions, scopes, idempotent, timeout_ms, effect, confirm, tenancy, handler.", "objective": "Define every invocable operation once."}
- **Projection / ActionManifest** - {"detail": "{actions:[{name,version,kind,spec_hash,scopes,idempotent,timeout_ms}], generated_at}.", "objective": "Expose the consumer-facing action list."}
- **Table / action_registry** - {"detail": "Verbatim from section 2.14; kind is external or workflow; spec_version and schema_hash pin ingest; timeout_ms and idempotent override it; enable/disable is approved_at.", "objective": "Persist external and workflow actions."}
- **Table / idempotency_key** - {"detail": "Scoped (tenant_id, action name, key) and claimed by INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.", "objective": "Make invocation retries replay-safe."}
- **Table / action_invocation** - {"detail": "The timeout case is written by a separate short transaction with outcome='timeout'.", "objective": "Record every invocation outcome."}
- **Table / audit_event** - {"detail": "Written in the same transaction as the mutation and invocation; the timeout record carries status='error'.", "objective": "Audit every mutation and failed invocation."}
- **Artefact / served-spec.lock.json** - {"detail": "Stores a per-operation sha256 of the $ref-resolved operation; regenerated by --write-lock, checked by --check-lock.", "objective": "Lock the served OpenAPI contract."}
- **External / External spec record** - {"detail": "Stores spec and schema_hash; a refresh writes an unapproved row alongside the approved spec_version; the highest approved version serves.", "objective": "Pin ingested external contracts."}
